<title>HONG KONG: China Xinjiang Airlines to lease Boeing 757-200.</title>
<headline>China Xinjiang Airlines to lease Boeing 757-200.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boeing Co said on Wednesday that China Xinjiang Airlines will lease a Boeing 757-200 from American International Group unit International Lease Finance Corp.</p>
<p>The airline, based in western China's Urumqi city, will take delivery of the aircraft in November, Boeing said in a statement received in Hong Kong.</p>
<p>The carrier, which curently operates two 737-300 aircraft and several Russian built planes, will use the new aircraft on routes to major cities throughout China, it said.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6590</p>
</text>
